# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow (2026-11-20): one Plaguelands sweep, at about 54.7-56.3 by the level model. From Felstone Field (end of 50-60/04): the Bulwark -> Dalson's
# Tears -> Andorhal (towers, Chromie's A Matter of Time and Counting Out Time) -> the Bulwark -> the Writhing Haunt and
# Mulgris -> the Eastern Plaguelands loop (Tirion's hunts, Light's Hope Chapel, Darrowshire, Marlene and Chromie by the
# Tarren Mill flight, Nathanos, Terrordale, Plaguewood, Corin's Crossing) -> Carlin -> Nathanos -> Tirion (Redemption,
# Mercutio) -> the Bulwark -> Kirsta and Northridge (Unfinished Business, Mickey's termite barrel) -> Gahrron's
# Withering -> the Bulwark (Mission Accomplished!) -> hearth to Orgrimmar -> Felwood, Moonglade and Winterspring ->
# Mount Hyjal from Everlook. The Plaguelands block that 50-60/06 did at 58.8-59.6 (cauldrons, Unfinished Business,
# Andorhal, Tirion's hand-ins) is done here, two to three levels earlier; the Gadgetzan, Linken and Silithus errands
# that ended this guide follow Mount Hyjal on 50-60/06. Left out: Heroes of Darrowshire (5168, a group quest at
# Hearthglen, handed back at Light's Hope), The Ranger Lord's Behest (6133, Rangers 59-60), Of Lost Honor (5845, the
# Mossflayers' lake), Kirsta's Hearthglen look-out (6025, Scarlets 58-60).
# Left out since the 0.3.6 flow pass: Camp Mojache (7492, Gorlach's 1500 XP delivery to Talo): it cost a flight from
# Gadgetzan to Camp Mojache and on to Marshal's Refuge instead of the direct flight.
# Added here (0.3.6 flow pass, from 50-60/01, where the guide was about 52.4 among level 54-57 mobs): Light's Hope
# Chapel's flight path and bind, Pamela's doll (5149), Zaeldarr (6021), Uncle Carlin (5241) and Defenders of
# Darrowshire (5211), and the Marlene/Chromie chain (5152, 5153, 5154) to Brother Carlin (5210). Brother Carlin opens
# Heroes and Villains of Darrowshire (5168, 5181), so the chain comes first.

