step Counting Out Time
  tip The lockboxes sit in Andorhal's ruined houses around Chromie's inn. Careful: Ghouls and skeletons usually stand next to the boxes and attack when you come close. Searing ghouls also hurt anyone nearby and will break stealth. A Flesh Golem, a level 56-57 elite, stands among the houses just east of the inn: take the boxes on the west side first and keep clear of it.
  collect 12638 quest 4972.1 @40.3,68.2 map 1422

