step Plaguewood: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Frenzied Plaguehounds share the fields around Northdale and Eastwall Tower, south of Zul'Mashar; Noxious Plaguebats fly over the fields of the north, and Monstrous Plaguebats around Northdale and Eastwall Tower. Careful: the hounds are 57-58 and the Monstrous Plaguebats up to 58: take the 57s one at a time and leave the 58s.
  kill 8598 quest 5542.3
  kill 8601 quest 6042.1
  kill 8602 quest 6042.2

