  collect 11515 x6 -- Corrupted Soul Shards from the cultists, for Maybess' Salve via Hunting

step A Strange Red Key
  when has 13140
  tip A Blood Red Key dropped: the Jaedenar Enforcers, Darkweavers, Warlocks and Legionnaires of Shadow Hold carry one now and then. Use it to start the quest, then free Arko'narin from her cage in the cave's south end on your way out.
  accept 5202 optional

step Captured Arko'narin
  when onquest 5202
  turnin 5202                         -- Captured Arko'narin, below ground
  accept 5203                         -- Captured Arko'narin: lead her out of Shadow Hold

step Rescue From Jaedenar
  when onquest 5203
  tip Lead Arko'narin out through the cave: she fights beside you, and the cultists you didn't clear on the way in come at you both. Jessir Moonbow takes her report at the Emerald Sanctuary, next.
  complete 5203 @35.5,59.1 map 1448      -- out of Shadow Hold, at its mouth

step Maybess Riverbreeze
  when available 5887
  when has 11515 x6
  tip Back south to the Sanctuary: Maybess takes the shards on the west side of the camp.
  turnin 5887 direct -- Maybess Riverbreeze

step Greta Mosshoof
  turnin 5242

step Jessir Moonbow
  when onquest 5203
  tip Jessir Moonbow, at the Sanctuary's east side, takes Arko'narin's report.
  turnin 5203                         -- Jessir Moonbow
  accept 5204                         -- Jessir Moonbow: Rakaiah, in Jaedenar, on the last guide's ride north through Felwood

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Northern Felwood and Moonglade

step Deadwood Cauldron
  zone Felwood
  tip Ride north up the whole Felwood road, past Bloodvenom Post. The cauldron stands in Felpaw Village, just south-west of Timbermaw Hold; the Deadwood furbolgs there are hostile.
  turnin 5084
  accept 5085

step Kernda
  when onquest 8471
  when rep "Timbermaw Hold" Neutral
  tip Only if a Winterfall Ritual Totem dropped for you and you are Neutral with the Timbermaw (the Timbermaw Hold reputation guide gets you there): Kernda waits at the Felwood entrance of Timbermaw Hold.
  turnin 8471 optional                -- Kernda walks around here: look inside the circle on the map

step Moonglade
  zone Moonglade
  goto 51.7,45.1 "Rabine Saturna"

step Rabine Saturna
  zone Moonglade
  tip Go through Timbermaw Hold and take the Moonglade branch of the tunnel. Rabine is in Nighthaven.
  tip Rabine offers A Reliquary of Purity only after you have been inside Dire Maul once: if he doesn't offer it, carry on without it.
  accept 5527 optional

step Rabine Saturna
  zone Moonglade
  turnin 1123
  accept 1124
  note Both quests lead to Silithus: keep them.

