  zone Winterspring
  goto 31.3,45.2 "Donova Snowden"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterspring

step Donova Snowden
  zone Winterspring
  tip From the tunnel's Winterspring exit, ride south to Frostfire Hot Springs.
  turnin 5085
  accept 5086
  turnin 3909
  accept 3912
  note Toxic Horrors are in Felwood, on a later trip: keep it.

step Moontouched Owlbeasts
  tip Ride east to Everlook and north out of it; the Moontouched Owlbeasts roam the hills of Frostsaber Rock's southern slopes. Careful: they are 57-58: pull them one at a time.
  tip Careful: Hailspite, level 60 elites, gather in the snowfields south-east of Everlook, where a few Moontouched Owlbeasts roam too: stay on the slopes north of town.
  kill 7453 quest 4741 @64.9,17.8

step Pristine Yeti Horns
  tip Umi's horns, carried from your last Everlook stop: the yeti hills start just south-east of Everlook. Only Matriarchs and Patriarchs drop horns, and the Patriarchs reach 58: pull them one at a time.
  collect 12367 quest 977             -- Below ground

step Umi Rumplesnicker
  turnin 977
  accept 5163
  note Umi's third prank targets goblins in Gadgetzan, Un'Goro and Everlook: keep it. Mount Hyjal is next: its way in starts here in Everlook; Gadgetzan, Linken's sword and Silithus follow it.
